  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup olive oil",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "2 tablespoons lemon juice",
    "1 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.5 pounds skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cut into bite-sized pieces",
    "6 wooden skewers, or as needed",
    "1 (6 ounce) container plain Greek-style yogurt",
    "0.5 cucumber - peeled, seeded, and grated",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 teaspoons white vinegar",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "1 pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vRlNDK3M5_n8vjREcC2bKdtUv6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-Step-1-0693-7f774ab166d54a26907ad5a7c4787aea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare kabobs: Combine olive oil, garlic, lemon juice, oregano, and salt in a large resealable bag. Add chicken, coat with the marinade, squeeze out excess air and seal the bag; marinate in the refrigerator for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gGiwsJG0EOY0ZVg3732fp6HAo5M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-Step-2-0694-2df7c65a0a9a4aa7a01f29635d936279.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Prepare sauce: Mix yogurt, cucumber, olive oil, vinegar, garlic, and salt together in a bowl. Refrigerate sauce for flavors to blend, 1 to 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pDqNYdDT4_ikSxU1AE6VOjqwfnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-Step-3-0696-245f7f5386b246d79cca878a36a363ac.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soak wooden skewers in a bowl of cold water for about 15 minutes. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat and lightly oil the grate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7WTngnWjk-vU8IfZ-opSrZVV0qs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-Step-4-0697-5b558c64a4de4b6a931d35db95db0884.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove chicken from marinade and thread onto the soaked skewers. Discard unused marinade.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/p3_sN2zEViUDP5d1D8pAseLXgd8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-Step-5-0698-be178cf6d3b84152aef381e32a7fe276.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook the skewers on the preheated grill, turning frequently until browned on all sides and chicken is no longer pink in the center, about 7 to 8 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Xa-xFuYKBHFH0Axq8nG96x3Qx3g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-Step-6-0705-435a55a41ca2429096426c03e062e68c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with tzatziki sauce. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dE4BKOlmnDsDe-IS_8GTp2NCWG8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231644-Chicken-Souvlaki-with-Tzatziki-Sauce-3x4-0725-d6573d70f50d4e4aa2dd85c2c49ad731.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231644/step_07.webp"
    }
